# Frontrow web — docs/04-technical-design.md §13. Copy to .env.local for dev.
# The FastAPI app; `/api/*` is rewritten to it server-side (next.config.ts).
API_URL=http://localhost:8000
# F5 — nothing to set: checkout gets the Razorpay key id from the api's order response, so the
# key lives in one place (api RAZORPAY_KEY_ID).
# The same value as the api's PROXY_SECRET: src/middleware.ts forwards the visitor's address with
# it, so per-network limits (seat holds, sign-in codes) see visitors, not this proxy.
PROXY_SECRET=
